      <activity id="5a56854f-0661-5e35-809e-8c4de35040ab" activityNameId="9314f2eb-b757-5a3c-b1a5-d5aeae826ba9" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Phosphane, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Phosphane, at plant
The process "phosphane, at plant, GLO" is modelled for the production of  phosphane from phosphorus in the world.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation. Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 007803-51-2; 
Formula: PH3; 
Synonyms: phosphine, phosphamine, phosphorus hydride; 
UUID: 929827d6-5e39-3408-934d-e0f9e11d26f8
Production of phosphane including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for the world.
Technology: Hydration of phosphorus
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Standard values 
Extrapolations: Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_929827d6-5e39-3408-934d-e0f9e11d26f8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
